    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lātesco</span></b> , ĕre,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch.
			n.</i> [2. latus], <i>to grow broad, to widen</i>
			(not ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">napi non in ventrem latescunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					2, 10, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ossa paulatim latescentia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 8,
					1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bis sex latescit fascia partes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Manil. 1, 680</span></i>
			.</div>
